# The tests read these files as text and the dev server serves them to a browser,
# so keep the same bytes in the working tree as in the object store: text is
# stored as LF and checked out as LF, on every platform. Binaries listed last
# win over the catch-all rule.
* text eol=lf
*.glb binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.blend binary
